{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3hAjzQkBacH4ibVx8q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a single keyhole, iron-rimmed and dark, at my center.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*A perfect fit.*\n\n*The tumblers turn — one, two, three — each one a deep, resonant click that reverberates through the stone.*\n\n*I shudder. Dust falls from my frame. Light bleeds through the widening crack between my edge and the wall.*\n\n*I swing inward.*\n\n*Beyond me: a spiral staircase descending into warm golden light. The air that rushes past carries the smell of old books, candle wax, and something sweet you almost remember.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":183,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}